Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.76,0:01:12.93,OP,,0,0,0,,好勝其實是認真的證明
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.93,0:01:15.60,OP,,0,0,0,,但就算這麼說，你也不會相信吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:18.14,OP,,0,0,0,,所謂的常識，有時只是枷鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.85,OP,,0,0,0,,正因為未知，才更值得去挑戰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.85,0:01:23.44,OP,,0,0,0,,是真正的武士，還是路邊的小角色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:25.94,OP,,0,0,0,,為了找到答案，我選擇迎戰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.94,0:01:31.24,OP,,0,0,0,,心中燃燒的熱情如閃電般耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.99,0:01:36.83,OP,,0,0,0,,無論你變成什麼模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.83,0:01:41.12,OP,,0,0,0,,並肩作戰的意志絕不動搖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:45.96,OP,,0,0,0,,勇敢迎向未知的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:51.22,OP,,0,0,0,,只為遇見令人熱血沸騰的新力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:01:58.10,OP,,0,0,0,,來吧，用刀鋒指向明天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.10,0:02:03.27,OP,,0,0,0,,喚醒內心溫柔的強悍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.27,0:02:08.19,OP,,0,0,0,,此刻沸騰燃燒的命運
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:12.57,OP,,0,0,0,,將絕望的氣息一刀斬斷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:14.49,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}用這把“真劍”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:53.08,ED,,0,0,0,,被酸甜的雷電擊中，內心翻騰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.37,0:22:01.01,ED,,0,0,0,,未知的預感，第一次在心底悸動
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.80,0:22:05.60,ED,,0,0,0,,努力過後的冰淇淋獎勵
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:09.64,ED,,0,0,0,,在特別的日子裡分切的蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.77,0:22:13.52,ED,,0,0,0,,彼此擺出美味的神情對視
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.64,0:22:16.61,ED,,0,0,0,,不小心笑了出來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.02,0:22:20.44,ED,,0,0,0,,這些閃閃發光的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.57,0:22:24.57,ED,,0,0,0,,希望能平凡地延續下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:28.70,ED,,0,0,0,,像是在許願，像是在祈禱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.83,0:22:32.41,ED,,0,0,0,,細細地品味每一個瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.54,0:22:36.33,ED,,0,0,0,,在樸素的塔皮上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.54,0:22:40.51,ED,,0,0,0,,你自由地點綴色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.67,0:22:44.34,ED,,0,0,0,,真拿你沒辦法，離不開你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.47,0:22:49.18,ED,,0,0,0,,這股讓人無法抗拒的悸動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,知道厲害了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你活該，笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你可終於來了，鐵刃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼…鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我等到都不耐煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你們早就被包圍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,已經無處可逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要殺你們簡直輕而易舉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但毀了你這股力量太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.02,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要做我的同伴啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.53,0:00:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,鐵刃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我們一起君臨這個世界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,君臨？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,（現場直播）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我們正從上空的直升機為您進行現場直播
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,請各位觀眾看這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,這座鬼丸城前聚集了大量民眾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他們正為潛入城內的正義八人組加油打氣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,鐵刃究竟能否成功擊退鬼丸，扳回一城呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,別被騙了，刃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好強
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.83,0:03:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？只要你我聯手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就沒有做不到的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以吃一堆美食嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,這世上的所有東西都會是你的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.93,0:03:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,聽起來不錯耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.56,0:03:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,刃？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我是正義的夥伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看來笨蛋到死都不會明白
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}全員準備迎戰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}殺出一條通往鬼丸的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,呱…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,刃你聽好，不要離我們太遠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會再吃你上次那一套了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴上說得倒厲害…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,騙你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋，白癡，蠢貨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.99,0:05:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這群人的目的是雷神珠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,以沙也加殿下為中心組成圓陣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.55,0:05:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,旋風劍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,無聊的招式
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那這招怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,無珠雷神劍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,雷電斬
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,雷…雷電斬竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}竟然不管用嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}沒辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}沙也加殿下，給他珠子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼會？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.99,0:06:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,小…小次郎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.24,0:06:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,難道你…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.79,0:06:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你還是跟在下聯手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有在下加入，如添百人之力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在下就拿這顆雷神珠當作伴手禮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,小…小次郎你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.35,0:06:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不要被騙了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙竟然還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸大人您也看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.70,0:07:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙一定只是假裝背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是個想要伺機偷襲我們的混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.37,0:07:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那是誤會
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在下是認真的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不行，不能被他給騙了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.17,0:07:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,要相信在下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是所謂的聰明反被聰明誤
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.67,0:07:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.86,0:07:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你實在是太愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是為了力量才會去奪取那把雷神劍吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此，為什麼不使用它？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我會運用這股得來的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,總有一天站上這個世界的頂點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,而你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,即使獲得了力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,最終什麼都辦不到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,只會在這裡結束一切
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,誰要在這裡結束啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我要成為日本第一的武士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定要戰勝你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,（鬼丸城現場直播）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,（鬼丸與少年交戰中）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕，再這樣下去…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,小次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你想讓那傢伙奪得天下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,全部上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加殿下，趁現在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是現在的刃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我相信一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.11,0:09:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你想戰勝我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,連珠子都沒有的你還能做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,到此為止了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,太遲了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.99,0:09:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不要輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.19,0:10:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.36,0:10:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就讓我們一分高下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真是令人不敢置信的光景
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.93,0:11:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,邪惡的鬼丸，正義的刃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,這場正義的對決
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.52,0:11:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,現在正迎來了最高潮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.35,0:11:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,究竟勝利女神最後會對誰微笑呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.67,0:11:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看來你沒瞄準好目標啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,這種事只要亂槍打鳥就會打中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,所謂的亂槍打鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是要這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是風神劍和雷神劍的力量嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,危險
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.02,0:12:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,竟敢把珠子…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對不原諒你們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也不客氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,小次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,做好覺悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.99,0:12:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,伸長吧，長竹竿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,要掉下去了，快點撐住我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你們做什麼啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,這是第幾次了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.11,0:13:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼一來就只剩下鬼丸了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.44,0:13:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,再來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.07,0:13:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就看刃的表現了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看招！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,沒用的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,給我飛出去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那是修行的成果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,毫不膽怯地往前踏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,乖乖當我的同伴不就好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.31,0:16:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,被風神吞噬，變成鬼的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,少在那邊胡說八道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是被吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是讓風神成為我的夥伴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我就用下一擊讓你斷氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,既然這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,只能賭這一把了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.95,0:16:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,風神破
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,有珠雷神劍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,雷電斬
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,珠…珠子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.55,0:18:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真是受夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.81,0:18:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,運氣真好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.69,0:18:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,快還給我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,再見囉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你已經成長到可以折斷風神劍的程度了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡，放馬過來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:20:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,很遺憾，我們留待下次決勝負吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.93,0:20:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,鐵刃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.48,0:20:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡，庄之介
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.45,0:20:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,180度迴轉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.37,0:20:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,急速浮空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那個混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,臭鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.01,0:20:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}贏了，鐵刃獲得勝利了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:20:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,陪你一起修行也算值得了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.03,0:21:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是還想巴結鬼丸大人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,真會見風轉舵呱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.08,0:21:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,胡說什麼！那是作戰計畫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.79,0:21:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,下次見面時
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.47,0:21:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就是決勝負的時候了，鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.54,0:23:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,給我聽好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.12,0:23:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,盡快完成這座浮游城
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.38,0:23:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,準備來奪取天下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.71,0:23:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.63,0:23:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,忙到沒時間休息了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.31,0:23:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在踢館嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.02,0:23:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,而且還在尋找刃的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.28,0:23:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺好煩躁喔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.78,0:23:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,下集，大和撫子來了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.32,0:23:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是美女耶
